Description:
{Chapel Guard + any Holy creature}
Your creatures in the lanes next to this creature take 1 less combat damage.

When one of your creatures would be destroyed: You may banish a fusion splice from under this creature. That creature survives with 1 HP instead.

{Blood Priest + any Unholy creature}
Once per turn: Banish 2 cards from your Waste Repository, or 1 fusion splice from under this creature, to restore 3 HP to a creature or gain 3 PHP.

Whenever you banish creature(s) this way: This creature gains +1 ATK permanently.

{any 2 Greedy creatures}
This creature rolls its die once for each fusion splice under it and keeps the highest result. (if you have no splices, only roll once) 

Once per turn: You may invest any amount of gold from your pool onto this creature. For each gold invested, choose +2 ATK or +2 HP permanently.

{Cat + Bunny}
If this creature doesn’t attack: Restore 1 HP to it at end phase.
Your opponent can only attack creatures with the name 'Bunny' or fusions which have splices named 'bunny' while this card is on the field.

{any 2 Ordinary creatures with different names}
Once per turn: Banish a fusion splice from under this creature to put a Complaint on each enemy creature.

(Complaint: the creature has -2 ATK for each one and its 'once per turn' effects don't work. Its controller may pay a 2 flux fine in their Main Phase to remove one.)

{any Unholy creature + any Greedy creature}
This creature has +1 ATK for each fusion splice under it.

Whenever another creature dies: Gain 1 gold or 1 PHP. If it was a creature you controlled (not a fusion), you may put it under this creature as a fusion splice instead.

{Judicator Angel + any Holy creature}
Radiance (when this creature is restored past its max HP, it gains your choice of +ATK or +HP equal to the extra, until your next turn).

When this creature attacks: Restore 2 HP to each creature you control for each fusion splice under this creature.

{any Holy creature + any Greedy creature}
Radiance (when this creature is restored past its max HP, it gains your choice of +ATK or +HP equal to the extra, until your next turn).

Once per turn: Pay X gold to restore 2X HP to a creature you control. Each fusion splice you banish from under this creature for this counts as 3 gold.
